WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Move the arm from the bottom center toward the blue box on the left side of the table.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Descend and close the gripper to grasp the blue box.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the blue box and transport it to the right toward the basket.

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Lower the blue box into the basket and open the gripper to release it.

5
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Retract the arm and move left to approach the green box.

6
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Descend and close the gripper to grasp the green box.

7
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Lift the green box and transport it to the right toward the basket.

8
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.900
Lower the green box into the basket and open the gripper to release it.
